Package: rcpa.mcpserver
Type: Package
Title: MCP Server Exposing the RCPA Bioinformatics Toolkit
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Phi", "Bya", email = "hungbya@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
  )
Description: Exposes RCPA differential expression, pathway, consensus,
    meta-analysis, and plotting workflows as Model Context Protocol tools
    over Streamable HTTP. Built on the mcpserver R framework. Each
    analysis runs in a fresh Rscript subprocess for isolation; results
    are persisted to disk and served back as resource_link URLs.
License: GPL-3 | file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends:
    R (>= 4.3)
